致谢与来源说明 / Attribution and Origins
--------------------------------------------------------------------

本项目的代码由 衔春 独立编写，未直接复制第三方源码。
在设计构想层面，本项目参考了以下 Operit 社区插件：

All code in this project is written independently by Xianchun.
No third-party source code is copied verbatim. At the level of
design ideas, this project referenced the following Operit
community plugins:

1. 花屋渲染器 / Garden Cottage Renderer (v1.0.0)
   作者 / Author: liebetee
   参考内容 / Referenced: 「聊天内 HTML 渲染」这一整体构想，
   即通过自定义 XML 标签在对话流中插入富文本区块的思路。
   Referenced concept: rendering HTML inline within chat by way of
   custom XML tags.

2. 渲染器 V2 / Renderer V2 (v2.0.0)
   作者 / Author: ljrlty
   参考内容 / Referenced: 将 Compose 卡片与 WebView 双通道
   并置的结构安排。
   Referenced concept: pairing a Compose-based card channel with a
   WebView channel in one package.

   说明：上述两个插件在 Operit 市场均标注「允许社区协作更新」，
   但未附带任何开源许可证文件或版权声明。为避免许可归属不明，
   本项目未沿用其条目，而是作为独立作品重新实现并以
   Apache License 2.0 发布。
   Note: both plugins are marked "open to community updates" in the
   Operit marketplace, yet neither ships a license file or copyright
   notice. To avoid ambiguous provenance, this project does not
   continue their entries; it is a clean reimplementation released
   under the Apache License 2.0.

3. Moodlet (v0.1.0)
   作者 / Author: Operit
   参考内容 / Referenced: 通过子包 description 向 AI 下发标签
   使用说明，从而让 AI 自行判断何时使用渲染的做法。
   Referenced concept: delivering tag usage instructions to the AI
   through a subpackage description, letting the model decide when
   to render.

4. 双语折叠 / Bilingual Fold (com.operit.bilingual_fold)
   作者 / Author: Operit
   参考内容 / Referenced: 「不自动注入提示词，改为在设置界面
   内置可复制文本，由使用者自行取用」的设计取向；以及
   <fold> 标签的语义约定。
   Referenced concepts: the design stance of never auto-injecting
   prompts, instead embedding copyable text in settings for users to
   take as needed; and the semantics of the <fold> tag.

--------------------------------------------------------------------
第三方标签兼容 / Third-party Tag Compatibility
--------------------------------------------------------------------

本渲染器在统计正文长度时会剥离 <fold>...</fold> 区块，
以兼容使用双语折叠插件的用户。该标签的定义归属其原作者。

This renderer strips <fold>...</fold> blocks when measuring body
length, for compatibility with users of the Bilingual Fold plugin.
The definition of that tag belongs to its original author.

